# Keep results - they are dissertation evidence
!results/
!results/runs/

# Mock runs are structural smoke tests, not evidence. Real runs are committed.
results/runs/*_mock/
results/runs/latest_*_mock.json

# Six dev-split retrieval evaluations left on the Raspberry Pi 5 on 13 August,
# minutes after the laptop's. They are unreported: nothing in the dissertation
# or the pre-registration cites them, and they contributed to no hypothesis. The
# laptop's nine equivalents in the same directory ARE tracked and are the ones
# amendment 1.3 records.
#
# Named exactly rather than by wildcard, deliberately. A pattern such as
# results/retrieval/*_dev.json would also hide the tracked laptop files from a
# future reader and would silently swallow any evaluation run later, which is
# the opposite of what this repository is for. Six names hide six files.
results/retrieval/20260813_084726_dev.json
results/retrieval/20260813_090256_dev.json
results/retrieval/20260813_090724_dev.json
results/retrieval/20260813_092602_dev.json
results/retrieval/20260813_092945_dev.json
results/retrieval/20260813_094559_dev.json
